//! @file
//! @brief High level project documentation and definitions.

//! @namespace fcarouge
//!
//! @brief Francois Carouge's projects namespace.
//!
//! @details The definitions and implementations of the library intended for
//! public usage: the sparse matrix and its operations, as the typed matrix of
//! TypedLinearAlgebra and the filter of Kalman. Lowers the name conflict probability in large projects. Use
//! using-declarations or namespace-alias-definition per your project
//! guidelines.

//! @namespace fcarouge::sparse
//!
//! @brief Sparse linear algebra public namespace.
//!
//! @details The patterns, their algebra, and the construction of a matrix from
//! them, apart from the other projects' definitions of the `fcarouge`
//! namespace.

//! @namespace fcarouge::sparse_linear_algebra
//!
//! @brief Sparse linear algebra library namespace.
//!
//! @details Scopes the library's implementation details apart from the
//! public definitions of the `fcarouge` and `fcarouge::sparse` namespaces.

//! @namespace fcarouge::sparse_linear_algebra::internal
//!
//! @brief Internal implementation details.
//!
//! @details Solely intended for this library usage. Do not rely on these
//! details in your projects.

//! @namespace fcarouge::test
//!
//! @brief Unit, integration, regression, and usage tests.
//!
//! @details Collection of tests for verification of the library.

//! @namespace fcarouge::sample
//!
//! @brief Usage samples.
//!
//! @details Collection of samples demonstrating the library.

//! @namespace fcarouge::benchmark
//!
//! @brief Performance benchmarks.
//!
//! @details Collection of benchmarks measuring the library.

//! @page unit_test_coverage Unit Test Code Coverage
//!
//! @htmlonly
